  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "One Application, Endless Possibilities: Your Mortgage Made Simple",
    "splashDescription": "The US mortgage market is undergoing a significant transformation! Moving beyond traditional bank-centric approaches, digital-first solutions like mortgage aggregators are rapidly becoming the preferred choice for borrowers seeking greater speed, efficiency, and personalized financial solutions. In fact, non-bank entities already originated 62% of US mortgages in 2022. The market for these efficient, digital lending solutions is projected to reach approximately $29.8 million USD by 2027, growing at a CAGR of 12.1% from 2022.",
